      "writtenOn": "2024-07-15T23:13:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We want it in all states. Its meant to trick CarMediaService and Media Center into seeing we\u0027re in an \"active\" playback state, so they\u0027ll show us as the source like they\u0027re meant to. This should happen agnostic of the current state. We always want it to briefly show connecting anytime we gain focus.\n\nIn particular, with the error state, we want them to show us so our error state can potentially be resolved. However, its worth mentioning that our primary error state is when no device is connected, which would mean there\u0027s no transport controls, which would mean there\u0027s no way for MC to send us a play such that focus could be asked for.",
